Adapted from examples/cfd/darcy_physics_informed at commit
b45a5c810c741e6b41f8515be24c51121f8fc21f:

  configs/official.yaml        from conf/config_pino.yaml (file kept unchanged; keys added below a marker)
  src/pino_darcy/physics.py    Diffusion class copied from utils.py; PhysicsInformer construction,
                               border treatment and L1 reduction from darcy_physics_informed_fno.py
  src/pino_darcy/model.py      model construction from darcy_physics_informed_fno.py
  src/pino_darcy/engine.py     training loop structure from darcy_physics_informed_fno.py
  src/pino_darcy/data.py       dataset id, file name, normalisation constants, crop and splits
                               from utils.py and download_data.py

Each of these files carries the original NVIDIA copyright and licence header and
a statement of the changes. The FNO model, the PhysicsInformer, the PDE base
class, the finite-difference derivatives and the checkpoint utilities are
imported from the PhysicsNeMo package and are not copied.

The Darcy flow dataset (Darcy_241) is downloaded at run time from the data
release of Li et al., "Fourier Neural Operator for Parametric Partial
Differential Equations" (https://github.com/neuraloperator/neuraloperator).
It is not redistributed in this repository.
